   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">5</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Risk</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><s>Employee direct access to GIC is currently not working</s></p></=
td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Closed</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><time datetime=3D"2026-05-12" class=3D"date-past">12 May 2026</tim=
e>&nbsp;</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
       <li data-uuid=3D"61b1332f-18d3-42da-9c3f-ff902a69b3bf">Candi to alig=
n with Mahdi, then possibly with Adam (Orion)</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"3515c4eb-d303-44fa-ab9b-86bf1c834460">
        <p>Context on <strong>Employees SSO into GIC:</strong></p>
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"95764f18-acba-41a3-b0e2-aeb1cd85f2c0">Basically, =
the GIC-NBIN version is meant for NBIN clients=20
          <ul>
           <li>On the other hand, the GIC-M app, which is accessible via We=
lcome app or direct url, is meant for either Desk or MFDO, and this version=
 requires more privileges. (Source: Joanne and Adam)</li>
          </ul></li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Question:</strong> Should the employees who now access G=
IC-NBIN via Compass (e.g. Zheng, Stan) be set up to access the full version=
 in the future?</p>
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"c79c3bb8-94b3-449a-808f-ef48b1b84f48"><strong>Ans=
wer: </strong>No, the full version cannot be made available to employees, o=
nly desk / MFDO should have access.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Question: </strong>For <strong>employees who now access =
the GIC-NBIN version via Compass,</strong> do they still need access to the=
 "client" version after employee access is launched? If yes, how?</p>
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"45dfd700-6242-43f0-aff8-3883e981fd8e">The problem=
 is, the client version is not integrated to Okta NBC tenant and we don't h=
ave SZ id in employee accounts anymore. If we need to support this use case=
, will have to find the solution.</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"250441ff-a96e-4372-95a8-fdf0f9fa5bd3"><strong>Ans=
wer:</strong> They would have a secondary external CX ID which links to the=
ir SZ ID, and SSO to the GIC-NBIN version via Compass</li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">6</td>
